---
description: Default to automation and simplification in every change
alwaysApply: true
---

# Automate & simplify

- **One source of truth**: Reuse existing domain helpers and UI kit (`YieldFields`, `ModalShell`, layout primitives). Extract shared grids/forms when the same field set appears twice (e.g. yield/pack).
- **Automate repetition**: Prefer scripted or batch updates (grep, shared constants) over hand-editing many files the same way.
- **Simplify UX and code**: Fewer steps for staff, fewer props/branches in components. Delete dead code and redundant fetches instead of adding flags.
- **Minimal diffs**: The smallest change that fixes the root cause beats a large refactor unless duplication is the root cause.
